MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_001: Ow, oh no! You got me!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_002: Hey, shiner. You look kinda worried. What's up?
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_003: Huh?
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_004: They were asking me how to throw a punch, see?
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_005: After I taught them the ins and outs, one of them\nasked to try it on me. Barely felt it.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_006: But I faked like I was hurt. Seeing the guy go down—\nthat's half the fun of punching!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_007: <NCA>"Sorry I interrupted their lesson."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_008: <NCB>"You had me fooled."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_009: <ACA>Hehe. I'll pass that along!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_010: <ACB>No kidding? Maybe I'm a better actor than I thought!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_011: I think you gotta goof around a little from time\nto time. Have some fun!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_012: Back in the day, I never would've done a silly fall\nlike that.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_013: And if people laughed at me, I would've gotten mad,\nmaybe broken some fingers.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_014: <NCA>"That doesn't sound like you."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_015: Nah, it's true. I used to get REALLY set off when I\nheard people laughing.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_016: See, in the village I came from, being tough was the\nmain thing. The strongest guys got all the girls.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_017: But...not me.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_018: They treated me like I was some kinda monster.\nLeft me out of things, made fun.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_019: I couldn't take it lyin' down, so I'd start yelling and\nthrowing punches.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_020: Sometimes, I hurt people without even meaning to.\nI felt really bad about that.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_021: But why'd they always have to treat me like the\nbutt of the joke?
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_022: Anyway, my village burned down in the war.\nA bunch of people probably died.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_023: I wanna say "good riddance," but... I don't know.\nMakes me regret some stuff.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_024: Maybe it would've gone better if I didn't get so mad?
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_025: So that's why I'm trying to turn the page. Act a little\nnicer to people.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_026: <NCA>"You're doing very well."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_027: Hehe. Aw, just following your example. Yours\nand Bertrand's.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_028: My big brother's always watching out for the people\naround him!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_029: Wouldn't wanna screw up and make my brother's\nghost mad at me!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_030: Hey, you hear the arena's all rebuilt now? Now I can\ngo back to my natural habitat!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_031: Hey, you hear they're rebuilding the arena? Soon,\nI'll be back in my natural habitat!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_032: <NCA>"That'll be a sight to see."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_033: <NCB>"I'm looking forward to it."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_A_034: Bwahaha! If there's one thing I can do, it's put\non a show!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_001: Ah!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_002: Grah! Hrah!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_003: Huh? Oh, hey, shiner! You're alive!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_004: I'm tough, but you gotta be made of some extra\nsturdy stuff to survive that.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_005: <NCA>"Are you...training?"
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_006: Yep! Just about smashed this thing to powder,\nI was smashin' it so hard.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_007: I got fired up 'cause tomorrow's match is all for you!\nWell, it was gonna be.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_008: <NCA>"For me?"
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_009: I didn't know where you went or how to find you.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_010: I thought if I did good enough in the arena,\nthe crowd would give a big roar.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_011: The arena's not rebuilt yet, but they said we could\nhave a free match.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_012: I thought if I did good enough, the crowd would give\na big roar!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_013: And you'd hear it! And maybe you'd come back!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_014: <NCA>"That's an...unusual plan."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_015: <NCB>"Sounds like a clever plan."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_016: <ACA>Hey, what do you want from me? Planning stuff's\nyour job! It was all I could think of.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_017: <ACB>Hehehe. I know, right? There's no way it wouldn't\nhave worked!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_018: I mean, when a crowd's really going wild, you can\nhear it the next town over. The ground even moves!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_019: Anyway, guess I don't have to do the match\nanymore... Unless you wanna join in.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_020: Whaddaya say? Wanna get in the ring with\nthe Butcher?
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_021: <NCA>"Bring it on."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_022: <NCB>"I'll give them a good fight."
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_026: 
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_023: <RSDS>Bwahaha! That's what we like to hear!
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_024: A match between you and me, imagine the crowd\nthat's gonna draw.
MID_SE_Ism_Gol_S_025: We'll make 'em cheer so hard, the whole\nworld shakes!